meta {
  name: 02 Get Status Counts
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lab-reports/counts
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Live per-status-tab counts (LABORATORY.docx §1.1 element 6). Same filter
  params as List Reports, minus `status`.

  Returns `{ all, pending, partialPending, saved, validationPending,
  resultDone, approved, published, errorReported, resultRejected }`.

  **Department visibility is per branch (Phase 2).** A report is visible when the department of the entry the viewing
  branch works the test with is unassigned or one of the caller's departments: for a report the branch HOLDS that is
  its own entry once the report was sent to it (`performingBranchLabTestId`), otherwise the order line's; for a report
  the branch only SENT (the sender view) it is the order line's entry. The row's `departmentId` is the department of
  the holding branch's entry.
}
